# Admin / CMS

- Dashboard must be professional, responsive and practical.
- Only include required management modules.
- CRUD modules should provide appropriate list, create, edit, delete, status and ordering controls.
- Use confirmation before destructive actions.
- Show loading, empty, error and success states.
- Admin UI is not a security boundary; enforce permissions on the server.
- Dynamic website content must come from the CMS/database after backend integration.
- Do not leave fake/mock production content after dynamic integration.
